                           (Z_to_bv 64 (tl + 256 * mtl)) (Z_to_bv 64 (DST + dcap)) a6 a7 x18 x19 x20 x21
                           s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6) F (Z_to_bv 64 0x14c94) fc None mm (seg_rom psegs)).
